                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "\"Playing History - The Plague\" is an absolutely fascinating educational game! The journey through 14th-century Florence is both captivating and informative, combining historical facts with an engaging narrative. The characters are well-developed, and the atmosphere truly allows you to feel the tension of the Black Death era. The attention to detail in the locations and events is impressive, bringing history to life in a way that is both fun and educational. Highly recommended for anyone who loves history or interactive storytelling!",
